// ************** MOS-MUSIC OpenHymnal ABC → JPW-ABC 1.0 **************\n// source = sources/openhymnal/OpenHymnal2014.06.abc\n// match = exact title match from content/production/tune-matching.json\n\n.Title\nTitle = 坚固保障（A Mighty Fortress Is Our God）\nKeyAndMeters = {1=D,4/4}\nWordsByAndMusicBy = Words: Martin Luther, 1529. Translation Frederic Henry Hedge, 1853.\nMusic: 'Ein Feste Burg (Isorhythmic)' Martin Luther, 1529.  Setting: "Common Service Book" (ULCA), 1917, alt.\ncopyright: public domain.  This score is a part of the Open Hymnal Project, 2013 Revision.\nExpression = {♩=110}\n\n.Voice\n1' | 1' 1' 5_ 6_ 7 | 1'_ 7_ 6 5 1' | 7 6 5 6 | 4_ 3_ 2 1 1' | 1' 1' 5_ 6_ 7 | 1'_ 7_ 6 5 1' | 7 6 5 6 | 4_ 3_ 2 1 1 | 3 5 6 #4 | 5 1 5 5 | 6 7 1' 7 | 1' 7 6 6 | 5 6 6 5 | 6 4 3 1' | 7 6 5 6 | 4_ 3_ 2 1 |\n\n.Words\nW1@1,1:\nA {might} y {for} / {tress} {is} / {our} {God,} a {bul} {wark} {nev} {er} {fail} / / {ing;} {Our} {help} {er} {He,} / a {mid} / {the} {flood} {of} {mor} {tal} {ills} {pre} {vail} / / {ing:} {For} {still} {our} {an} {cient} {foe} {doth} {seek} {to} {work} {us} {woe;} {His} {craft} {and} {pow'r} {are} {great,} {and,} {armed} {with} {cru} {el} {hate,} {On} {earth} {is} {not} {his} e / / {qual.}\n